This is inactivity warning <%= @warning_count %> of 3 for the Gather community "<%= @community.name %>".

Last login: <%= @last_login_at ? l(@last_login_at.to_date) : "Never" %>

<% if @is_final %>
No one in your community has logged into Gather in over 90 days. This is the final warning before your community data is permanently deleted.

Your community will be deleted in approximately 7 days unless someone logs in.
<% else %>
No one in your community has logged into Gather in over 90 days. If no one logs in, another warning will be sent in 7 days. After 3 warnings, your community data will be permanently deleted.
<% end %>

To prevent deletion, simply log into your community at:
<%= root_url %>

If you believe this warning is in error or need help, please contact us at support@gather.coop.
